So, Posit Assistant is shaped similarly to a cloud code or a codex in terms of the tools

00:27:28.199 --> 00:27:35.160
that it has access to. So, it can run bash code, run Python code, run R code. And as such,

00:27:35.160 --> 00:27:42.760
it can access the documents that it needs to. Specifically for auditing correctness,

00:27:42.760 --> 00:27:47.400
if it's not inside of the directory that you're working in or otherwise mentioned in your

00:27:47.400 --> 00:27:50.439
